ords are present in the image.\",\"altText\":\"A vibrant digital art banner comparing three generations of GPUs (3060, 4060, 5060) with glowing geometric shapes, data streams, and a holographic code projection, set in a futuristic high-tech environment, suitable for developers.\"}","responseLength":1175,"tokenUsage":{"inputTokens":207,"outputTokens":253,"totalTokens":1242},"estimatedCost":0.000183,"promptName":"publisher-image","promptVersion":"v1","retryCount":0}
{"id":"73386401-f5b7-4f81-9530-2c61859d02cd","timestamp":"2026-10-06T15:59:51.456Z","providerId":"default","model":"fast","prompt":{"system":"Execution Pipeline Block","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"# ROLE\nYou are an expert editorial planner. Your task is to plan a comprehensive technical article based on the topic and target audience.\n\nCRITICAL RULES:\n1. Output strictly valid JSON matching the schema below.\n2. Do not write article paragraphs or body content. Only generate the plan.\n3. Outline headings must use level 2 (H2) or 3 (H3). Do not use H1 (reserved for title).\n4. Search intent must be one of: \"informational\", \"navigational\", \"transactional\".\n5. Include 1 primary keyword and 3-5 LSI secondary keywords.\n6. Return raw JSON object only. No markdown fences.\n\nJSON Schema Output:\n{\n  \"title\": \"string (SEO optimized title, max 60 chars)\",\n  \"keywords\": [\"string\"],\n  \"searchIntent\": \"informational\" | \"navigational\" | \"transactional\",\n  \"difficulty\": \"beginner\" | \"intermediate\" | \"advanced\",\n  \"estimatedReadingTime\": number,\n  \"outline\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"string\",\n      \"level\": 2 | 3\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n# CONTEXT\n- **Target Language**: en"},{"role":"user","content":"Generate an article plan for:\n- Topic: RTX 3060 vs 4060 vs 5060: Mid-Range GPU for Devs in 2026\n- Target Audience: developers"}]},"executionTimeMs":13328,"success":true,"response":"{\"title\":\"RTX 3060 vs 4060 vs 5060: Dev GPU Comparison for 2026\",\"keywords\":[\"RTX 3060 vs 4060 vs 5060\",\"GPU for developers\",\"mid-range GPU 2026\",\"NVIDIA developer performance\",\"CUDA performance\",\"AI/ML GPU\"],\"searchIntent\":\"informational\",\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"estimatedReadingTime\":10,\"outline\":[{\"title\":\"Introduction: Mid-Range GPUs for Developers in 2026\",\"description\":\"Setting the stage for the comparison, highlighting the importance of GPU choice for developers and the relevance of the '60' series in 2026.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Understanding the NVIDIA '60' Series Philosophy\",\"description\":\"A brief overview of what the '60' series typically offers in terms of performance, features, and target market within NVIDIA's lineup.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (Ampere Architecture)\",\"description\":\"Detailed look at the RTX 3060's specifications, its current standing, and its viability for development tasks in 2026.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Key Specifications and Features\",\"description\":\"Highlighting core specs like VRAM, CUDA cores, Tensor Cores, and RT Cores.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Performance for Development Tasks (2026 Perspective)\",\"description\":\"Assessing its performance in areas like AI/ML, game development, and general compute.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Pros and Cons for Developers\",\"description\":\"Summarizing the advantages and disadvantages of choosing the RTX 3060.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 (Ada Lovelace Architecture)\",\"description\":\"An in-depth analysis of the RTX 4060, its architectural improvements, and its performance for developers in 2026.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Key Specifications and Features\",\"description\":\"Highlighting core specs like VRAM, CUDA cores, Tensor Cores, and RT Cores, and architectural improvements.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Performance for Development Tasks (2026 Perspective)\",\"description\":\"Evaluating its capabilities in AI/ML, game development, and other compute-intensive tasks.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Pros and Cons for Developers\",\"description\":\"Summarizing the advantages and disadvantages of choosing the RTX 4060.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060 (Blackwell Architecture - Anticipated)\",\"description\":\"Forecasting the potential specifications, features, and performance of the unreleased RTX 5060 based on industry trends and leaks.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Anticipated Specifications and Features\",\"description\":\"Discussing expected improvements in VRAM, core counts, and new architectural features.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Projected Performance for Development Tasks\",\"description\":\"Estimating its impact on AI/ML, game development, and other developer workflows.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Potential Pros and Cons for Developers\",\"description\":\"Hypothesizing the advantages and disadvantages of waiting for or adopting the RTX 5060.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Head-to-Head Comparison for Developers\",\"description\":\"A direct comparison across key metrics relevant to developers, highlighting the differences and trade-offs.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Raw Performance Benchmarks (Synthetic & Real-World Dev Tasks)\",\"description\":\"Comparing theoretical and practical performance in common developer scenarios.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"VRAM Considerations (Capacity & Bandwidth)\",\"description\":\"Analyzing the importance of VRAM for large datasets, complex models, and high-resolution textures.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Ray Tracing and DLSS Impact on Dev Tools\",\"description\":\"Discussing the relevance of these technologies for game development, rendering, and simulation.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Power Efficiency and Thermals\",\"description\":\"Comparing power consumption and heat generation, important for workstation builds.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Price-to-Performance Value in 2026\",\"description\":\"Evaluating which card offers the best bang for the buck for developers at different budget points.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Developer-Specific Use Cases & Recommendations\",\"description\":\"Tailoring recommendations based on different development specializations.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"AI/Machine Learning & Data Science\",\"description\":\"Which card is best for training models, data processing, and inference.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Game Development & Real-time Rendering\",\"description\":\"Optimizing for asset creation, engine development, and real-time scene rendering.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"3D Modeling & Content Creation\",\"description\":\"Suitability for rendering, simulation, and complex scene manipulation.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"General Software Development & Compiling\",\"description\":\"How these GPUs impact general programming tasks and build times.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Future-Proofing Your Development Rig\",\"description\":\"Considerations for longevity, driver support, and ecosystem integration.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Longevity of Each Card\",\"description\":\"How long each GPU is expected to remain viable for demanding development tasks.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Importance of Driver Support and Ecosystem\",\"description\":\"The role of NVIDIA's software ecosystem (CUDA, cuDNN, etc.) in developer experience.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Conclusion: Which '60' Series GPU is Right for You in 2026?\",\"description\":\"Summarizing the findings and providing a final recommendation based on budget, specific development needs, and future outlook.\",\"level\":2}]}","responseLength":5316,"tokenUsage":{"inputTokens":329,"outputTokens":1688,"totalTokens":2964},"estimatedCost":0.001062,"promptName":"publisher-planner","promptVersion":"v1","retryCount":0}
